{"sourceUrl":"https://sist.bfsu.edu.cn/info/1401/4971.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:39.408816+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sist.bfsu.edu.cn/info/1401/4971.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，全面落实全国研究生教育大会精神，紧紧围绕落实立德树人根本任务，为更好地选拔优秀人才，根据教育部、北京市和学校文件精神，结合我</span></span><span>院</span><span><span>实际情况，特制定</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>信息科学技术学院（以下简称</span><span>“信科学院”）</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span>研究</span><span><span>生</span></span><span>接收</span><span><span>工作方案。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、</span></strong><strong><span><span>接收推免生考务组织方案</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span> 我</span></span><span>院</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>推免</span><span><span>研究生工作将采取</span></span><span>现场考核的方式</span><span><span>进行</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>具体安排</span></span><span>如下</span><span><span>：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>1</span><span>、网上报名：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span> 参照《北京外国语大学关于接收</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）工作办法》（</span></span><span><a href=\"https://graduate.bfsu.edu.cn/info/1048/3756.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://graduate.bfsu.edu.cn/info/1048/3756.htm</span></a></span><span><span>）</span>完成网上报名。</span></p><p><span> 报名网址：</span><span>北外研究生院网站→招生管理平台→“推免生报名” </span><span>(</span><span><a href=\"https://yjszs.bfsu.edu.cn/#/homeIndex\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yjszs.bfsu.edu.cn/#/homeIndex</a></span><span>)</span><span>；</span></p><p><span> 报名时间截止至</span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核形式：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span> 资格审查、面试、笔试</span></span><span>。</span><span><span>未参加上述任</span></span><span>三</span><span><span>环节</span></span><span>任何之一者</span><span><span>，视为自动放弃资格，所参加</span></span><span>其它</span><span><span>环节成绩无效。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3</span><span>、电子</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>版材料资格审</span></span></strong><strong><span>核</span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p><p><span> 电子</span><span><span>版材料</span></span><span>上传</span><span>截止</span><span><span>时间：</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span>1</span><span><span>7:</span></span><span>00</span></p><p><span> 请将</span><span><span>身份证原件</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>学生证原件</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>本科成绩单原件</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>本科所在学校推免生资格及专业排名证明原件</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>其他所获奖项证明</span></span><span>等材料</span><span>扫描后</span><span>上传至招生系统</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>我</span><span><span>院</span></span><span>拟</span><span><span>于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span>日前后</span><span><span>在学院网站公布经审核确认的准考名单</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4</span><span>、准考学生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>资格审查</span></span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>资格审查内容：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1) </span><span><span>身份证原件：</span></span><span>须在</span><span><span>有效期内；</span></span></p><p><span>2) </span><span><span>学生证原件：每学期均要注册；</span></span></p><p><span>3) </span><span><span>本科成绩单原件：</span></span><span>须</span><span><span>加盖学校教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span>4) </span><span><span>本科所在学校</span></span><span>（或学院）</span><span><span>推免生资格及</span></span><span>学</span><span><span>业排名证明原件。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 申请人在我校报名系统填报的个人基本信息，包括</span><span>“推免排名（申请人在本科就读高校同年级所有该专业的学生总人数中的排名）”等，须与资格审查时提交的证明材料一致，也须与</span><span>9</span><span>月底本科学校向教育部的“中国研招网”推免生服务系统上报的信息一致，否则为信息造假，等同于作弊，一经查实，取消推免考试资格或拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span> 资格</span><span><span>审核</span></span><span>费用缴纳事宜</span><span><span>请</span></span><span>关注北外研究生院官网通知。</span></p><p><span><span> 若考生放弃</span></span><span>准考资格</span><span><span>，应提交本人签名的放弃申明书，于</span></span><span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span><span>:</span></span></span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>前发送至</span>bwjsj@bfsu.edu.cn<span>邮箱。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>5</span><span>、笔</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>试时间：</span></span></strong><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>日</span>9</span><span><span>:</span></span><span>00</span><span>进行</span><span><span>签到、</span></span><span>资格审查、</span><span><span>抽签</span></span><span>环节，</span><span><span>9:30 - 11:30</span><span>进行笔试</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>面</span></strong><strong><span><span>试时间：</span></span></strong><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>下</span><span><span>午</span>13</span><span><span>:3</span></span><span>0</span></p><p><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、总成绩：</span></span></strong><span><span>总成绩（百分制）</span>=</span> <span><span>笔试成绩</span><span>×50%+</span><span>面试成绩</span><span>×50%</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>8</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、拟录取规则：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span> 按总成绩由高到低顺序录取，</span></span><span>总成绩相同时，优先录取笔试成绩高者，</span><span><span>笔试成绩、面试成绩有一项不及格者不予录取。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>9</span><span>、接收录取：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>申请人须登录“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“中国研招网推免生系统”，网址：</span><span><a href=\"http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></a></span><span>）进行注册，填写报考学校、专业志愿等。考生在接收待录取通知后，须在规定时间内通过“中国研招网推免生系统”确认接受，方视为完成拟录取手续，否则视为放弃。</span></p><p><strong><span>二、信息公开、</span></strong><strong><span><span>咨询及申诉渠道公开</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、信息公开：</span></span></p><p><span>   按学校研究生院统一要求，需要学院公开的内容将在学院网站</span><span>https://sist.bfsu.edu.cn/</span><span><span>和学院公告栏（北外西校区国际大厦</span><span>8</span><span>层东南角）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>为保证</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生推荐免试工作公平、公正，方便考生反映复试录取的有关情况，我</span></span><span>院</span><span><span>公布</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生推荐免试工作联系方式：</span></span></p><p><span>信息科学技术学院</span><span><span>咨询电话：</span>010-</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>8816569</span><span>、</span><span>88817500</span><span><span>、</span><span>8</span></span><span>8818279</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>、申诉渠道：</span><span><span>北京外国语大学研招办电话：</span>010-88816246<span>、</span><span>010-88816244</span><span>（传真）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>北京外国语大学纪委办公室电话：</span>010-88816259<span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>北京教育考试院研招办招生专用监督电话：</span>010-82837456<span>。</span></span></p><p><span>信息科学技术学院</span></p><p><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"1895dd6303babed28e99b79c5e6eefcfaf223e662ad17685e5688fc1ac4964d0","textLength":1561,"sourceSha256":"56d5a5800cf975e585791cfffd73f7d97135e173a31be23fdfa4717ddf65d629","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-632c20824574be296ac9","title":"2025年北京外国语大学信息科学技术学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:39.408816+00:00"}
